{"station_id":"740000004","name":"Alvesta","updated":"2026-10-22","quality":"osm_draft","sources":[{"type":"osm","license":"ODbL","retrieved":"2026-10-20","url":"https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright"},{"type":"manual","retrieved":"2026-10-22","note":"Länstrafiken Kronoberg, 'Avgångsplatser och service, Alvesta station' (valid from 10 December 2023; PDF supplied by the owner, also linked from Jernhusen's station page): track order, the footbridge's stairs and lifts at both ends and in the middle, and the waiting room, toilets, ticket machines and shop in the station building. Read off the plan, nothing traced. Not ODbL: Länstrafiken hasn't licensed the plan; see data/stations/README.md."},{"type":"website","url":"https://lanstrafikenkron.se/alvesta-station","retrieved":"2026-10-22","note":"Länstrafiken Kronoberg's Alvesta station page: four lifts (lift 1 in the west stair tower, lifts 2 and 3 from the bridge to the two islands, lift 4 in the east stair tower), ticket machines in the waiting room and on the bridge, two toilets, waiting-room hours Mo-Fr 03.30-01.00, Sa 03.30-23.45, Su 06.30-01.00 (Jernhusen's page gives the station 03.15 instead of 03.30 on weekdays and Saturdays; the later time is used). Lift positions on the islands are not given and are placed under the bridge."},{"type":"website","url":"https://www.jernhusen.se/hitta-din-station/alvesta-station/mat-och-butiker/","retrieved":"2026-10-22","note":"Jernhusen's list of shops in the station building (Antikvariatet Bokpärlan, Alvesta kommuns utställningshall, Pressbyrån) and their hours; toilet page (toilet and accessible toilet, card payment; its accessibility page says coins, so the fee is left unknown). Pressbyrån is placed at OpenStreetMap's point; the other places in the building are not placed in any source, so they are pins near the middle of the building."},{"type":"trafikverket","retrieved":"2026-10-22","note":"Trafikverket TrainStation (Av) PlatformLine 1–4 with sectors, and TrackAtLocation v